{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An icon element that can be used at the leading or trailing position of a list item"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSStaticListItem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSNavigationListItem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/init(status:description:size:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/IconStatus","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/Size"],"title":"Enumerations"},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSListItemIcon"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" displays a status icon (info, warning, positive, negative) with a predefined asset,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or a custom neutral icon from a provided image. Each icon type has a semantic color applied automatically","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"based on the current theme.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional notification badge can be attached to neutral icons to indicate additional status.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Status","type":"heading","anchor":"Status"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/IconStatus"},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the available icon variants:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".neutral(asset:badge:)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A custom icon from a provided "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Image"},{"type":"text","text":" asset, rendered with the default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"content color. An optional notification badge (small dot) can be displayed at the top-trailing corner."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".positive","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A predefined checkmark\/confirmation icon with a positive (green) semantic color."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".info"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A predefined information icon with an informational (blue) semantic color.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".warning"}]},{"text":": A predefined warning icon with a warning (yellow\/orange) semantic color.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This icon uses a two-layer rendering with distinct internal and external shape colors.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".negative"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A predefined alert\/important icon with a negative (red) semantic color.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Sizes","level":2,"anchor":"Sizes"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/Size","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the available sizes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".medium","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The default size, corresponding to the theme’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"controlItem.sizeAssetMedium","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" token.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".large","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The largest size, corresponding to the theme’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"controlItem.sizeAssetLarge","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" token.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Note:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" When the icon is embedded in a list item with small size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftUI\/View\/oudsListItemSize(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), the icon is always rendered at its smallest size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"regardless of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"size"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Info icon with medium size (default)","    OUDSListItemIcon(status: .info, description: \"Something new\")","","    \/\/ Warning icon with large size","    OUDSListItemIcon(status: .warning, description: \"Mobile data almost used\", size: .large)","","    \/\/ Negative icon with medium size","    OUDSListItemIcon(status: .negative, description: \"Payment failed\", size: .medium)","","    \/\/ Custom neutral icon without badge","    OUDSListItemIcon(status: .neutral(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"), descritpion: \"Emails\"))","","    \/\/ Custom neutral icon with notification badge","    OUDSListItemIcon(status: .neutral(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"), description: \"New emails received\", badge: true))","","    \/\/ Usage as leading element in a list item","    OUDSStaticListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: \"Information\"),","        leading: .icon(OUDSListItemIcon(status: .info, description: \"\", size: .medium))","    )","","    \/\/ Usage as trailing element in a list item","    OUDSStaticListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: \"Warning\"),","        trailing: .icon(OUDSListItemIcon(status: .warning, description: \"\", size: .medium))","    )"]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslistitemicon"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"metadata":{"platforms":[{"beta":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"},{"beta":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0"},{"beta":false,"name